### BNSAT-R - Bitcoin Node Security & Resilience Research

**Lead Organisation:** UBRO CLASSIFIEDS LIMITED
**Location:** Uganda
**Research Programme:** BNSAT-R
**Proposed Research Project:** BNRB - Bitcoin Node Resilience Benchmark
**Version:** 0.1 - Working Research Draft
**Date:** July 2026

