# 13. Proposed Experimental Design

The proposed pilot would operate in a controlled laboratory environment.

A possible experimental architecture is:

```text
                 TEST NETWORK
                      │
          ┌───────────┼───────────┐
          │           │           │
          ▼           ▼           ▼
       NODE A      NODE B      NODE C
       Baseline   Constrained   Variable
          │           │           │
          └───────────┼───────────┘
                      │
                      ▼
                 MONITORING
                      │
                      ▼
               DATA COLLECTION
                      │
                      ▼
                  ANALYSIS
```

The experiments would compare baseline and constrained environments.

Potential scenarios include:

### Scenario A

Normal operation.

### Scenario B

Graceful shutdown and restart.

### Scenario C

Unexpected shutdown.

### Scenario D

Short network interruption.

### Scenario E

Extended network interruption.

### Scenario F

Intermittent connectivity.

### Scenario G

Storage pressure.

### Scenario H

CPU or memory pressure.

Each experiment would be conducted repeatedly where appropriate.

The goal would be to determine whether observed behaviour is reproducible.

