# 16. Preliminary Research Gap Statement

Based on the initial review, BNSAT-R proposes the following preliminary research-gap hypothesis:

> **While Bitcoin network resilience, infrastructure resilience, node deployment and node resource behaviour have each received significant attention, there may be an opportunity to develop a reproducible experimental methodology for measuring the operational resilience and recovery behaviour of individual Bitcoin full-node deployments under controlled infrastructure disruptions and resource constraints.**

This statement is intentionally cautious.

It is a hypothesis requiring further validation.

The research should not claim that this gap is definitively novel until a more comprehensive systematic review and expert review have been completed.

